{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZR","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以斯拉记","commonName":"以斯拉记","title":"以斯拉记","order":15,"numberOfChapters":10,"sha256":"5944c35be07b21a6f86820d4c43926912625d824c4e6f05efc3577c9edfb73df","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZR/1.json","lastChapterNumber":10,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZR/10.json","totalNumberOfVerses":280},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["塞鲁士下令犹太人返国"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["波斯王塞鲁士元年，耶和华为要应验借耶利米口所说的话，就激动波斯王塞鲁士的心，使他下诏通告全国说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「波斯王塞鲁士如此说：『耶和华天上的 神已将天下万国赐给我，又嘱咐我在犹大的耶路撒冷为他建造殿宇。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["在你们中间凡作他子民的，可以上犹大的耶路撒冷，在耶路撒冷重建耶和华—以色列 神的殿（只有他是 神）。愿 神与这人同在。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["凡剩下的人，无论寄居何处，那地的人要用金银、财物、牲畜帮助他，另外也要为耶路撒冷 神的殿甘心献上礼物。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["于是，犹大和便雅悯的族长、祭司、利未人，就是一切被 神激动他心的人，都起来要上耶路撒冷去建造耶和华的殿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他们四围的人就拿银器、金子、财物、牲畜、珍宝帮助他们",{"noteId":0},"，另外还有甘心献的礼物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["塞鲁士王也将耶和华殿的器皿拿出来，这器皿是尼布甲尼撒从耶路撒冷掠来、放在自己神之庙中的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["波斯王塞鲁士派库官米提利达将这器皿拿出来，按数交给犹大的首领设巴萨。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["器皿的数目记在下面：金盘三十个，银盘一千个，刀二十九把，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["金碗三十个，银碗之次的四百一十个，别样的器皿一千件。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["金银器皿共有五千四百件。被掳的人从巴比伦上耶路撒冷的时候，设巴萨将这一切都带上来。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"原文是坚固他们的手","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":6}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZR/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZR/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CH/36.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}